{"program_id":"godseed-mission","node":{"id":"reconstruction","type":"directive-section","title":"Existing systems — reconstruct before changing","text":"Inspect actual branches, code, specs, tests and deployments for https://github.com/akadaan310/purl, https://github.com/akadaan310/NetGovComEduGovOrgEduGovComNet (ACSP), https://github.com/akadaan310/seurl and https://github.com/akadaan310/substrateIO. Read the **original mathematicians' handoff included in `reference/math_handoff/`**. Do not accept claims without checking source and proof status. Reconcile duplicated definitions, migration collisions and deployment versions. Make PURL the public language/namespace; ACSP supplies continuity and authority semantics; SubstrateIO supplies transition mathematics, observation and projections; SEURL's seven verbs START, SWITCH, WRITE, COMMIT, BUILD, TALK, PERTURB are historical candidate grammar primitives/macros and must be compared, not blindly imported. Produce a source-grounded reconstruction and compatibility matrix.","dependencies":["mission"],"status":"NOT_RUN","effects":["local-state"],"operations":["inspect","propose","checkpoint"],"tests":[{"id":"reconstruction:evidence","assertion":"Evidence is addressable, verified and meets the stated requirement"}],"completion_predicate":{"operator":"all","clauses":[{"operator":"dependencies_pass"},{"operator":"evidence_verified"},{"operator":"tests_pass"}]},"evidence":[],"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/mission/reconstruction"},"dependencies":[{"id":"mission","type":"directive-section","title":"Mission and naming","text":"Canonical name **PURL (P-U-R-L), Programmable URLs**, pronounced pearl. Build the fully functional public PURL service and AI-native computational programming environment. One integrated mission: product, compiler, SDK, persistent continuity, sandbox runtime, mathematical instrumentation, 10 experiments, gorgeous public UI, and end-to-end deployment where authorized. Do not stop at research, a plan, static screenshots, or a toy MVP. Preserve historical projects; no Golden Surface/Netscape dependency. A PURL is an addressable executable program with state, transitions, authority, history, and discoverable operations.","dependencies":[],"status":"NOT_RUN","effects":["local-state"],"operations":["inspect","propose","checkpoint"],"tests":[{"id":"mission:evidence","assertion":"Evidence is addressable, verified and meets the stated requirement"}],"completion_predicate":{"operator":"all","clauses":[{"operator":"dependencies_pass"},{"operator":"evidence_verified"},{"operator":"tests_pass"}]},"evidence":[],"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/mission/mission"}],"operations":[{"name":"fork","method":"POST","href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/fork","available":false,"requires":["authenticated","read"],"effects":["local-state"],"input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"expected_version":{"type":"integer","const":1}},"required":["expected_version"]},"prepare":{"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/p/godseed-mission?prepare=fork","mode":"human-mediated","description":"Read-only clients can prepare this operation in the browser; mutations require a bearer session."}},{"name":"checkpoint","method":"POST","href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/checkpoint","available":false,"requires":["authenticated","checkpoint"],"effects":["local-state"],"input_schema":{"type":"object","properties":{"expected_version":{"type":"integer","const":1},"summary":{"type":"string"},"next":{},"evidence":{}},"required":["expected_version"]},"prepare":{"href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/p/godseed-mission?prepare=checkpoint","mode":"human-mediated","description":"Read-only clients can prepare this operation in the browser; mutations require a bearer session."}},{"name":"propose","method":"POST","href":"http://127.0.0.1:8080/api/programs/godseed-mission/propose","available":false,"requires":["authenticated","propose"],"effects":[